PROJECT ShopAPI

TARGET PHP

PROFILE ECOMMERCE
USE payment.razorpay
USE notification.email

DATABASE MYSQL

AUTH JWT

MODEL User
    name STRING
    email STRING
    password STRING

MODEL Product
    name STRING
    sku STRING
    price INTEGER

MODEL Order
    status STRING
    total INTEGER

RELATION User HAS_MANY Order
RELATION Product HAS_MANY Order

VALIDATE email REQUIRED EMAIL
VALIDATE password REQUIRED MIN

ROUTE POST /login
ROUTE GET /products
ROUTE GET /orders
